---
// PullQuote — a visual pause around one memorable sentence already in
// the article's own text. No box, large editorial serif type, one
// accent color, no decorative quotation marks.
//
// Use: 1 per normal article; a very long article may use 2. Never add
// one just to fill space where a Field Note doesn't exist yet.
//
// Usage: <PullQuote>He met them where they were at.</PullQuote>
---

<p class="fm-pull-quote"><slot /></p>
